            "text": "SOP → VOL → SOP Round-Trip\n\nDemonstrates the full conversion pipeline:\n  1. TorusSOP → mesh geometry\n  2. SOPtoVOL → rasterize into 64³ density grid\n  3. BlurVOL → smooth the density (rounds edges)\n  4. MarchingCubesVOL → extract iso-surface back to mesh\n\nThe bottom row shows raymarched views of the volume\nbefore and after blurring. The NullSOP at the end\nholds the reconstructed mesh for downstream use.",
